        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/e6e91c299440c8445c30c7c26491cf77.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⠀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your turf from incoming rival’s invasion in this tower defense game. Deploy your henchmen positioning them on the rooftops of the favela to stop enemies from invading and protect your territory. Hold out as long as possible to earn even greater rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⠀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/0cf4289e14f026c61acdac8129d5894b.poster.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/0cf4289e14f026c61acdac8129d5894b.webm?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/0cf4289e14f026c61acdac8129d5894b.mp4?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce your defense spending the money you earn recruiting allies and placing them in tactical spots. Also, you can make upgrades for their guns to improve your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/dc7af7bdd6edea1a33c20e8b5ee018f6.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face new challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different maps and test your skills with increasingly difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/81c4731e7bda60257935101e0072f1e4.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn and use ability cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and spend credits after the end of each run to buy abilitiy cards to make it harder for enemies to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/57f3d6bba6e15b2a46419b7573b900a4.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the ranks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve higher scores and rise above other players on the local and global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/b91f85fbcad805c9faa274ce3ac425c1.poster.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/b91f85fbcad805c9faa274ce3ac425c1.webm?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/b91f85fbcad805c9faa274ce3ac425c1.mp4?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/e6e91c299440c8445c30c7c26491cf77.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⠀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your turf from incoming rival’s invasion in this tower defense game. Deploy your henchmen positioning them on the rooftops of the favela to stop enemies from invading and protect your territory. Hold out as long as possible to earn even greater rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">⠀</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/0cf4289e14f026c61acdac8129d5894b.poster.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/0cf4289e14f026c61acdac8129d5894b.webm?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/0cf4289e14f026c61acdac8129d5894b.mp4?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce your defense spending the money you earn recruiting allies and placing them in tactical spots. Also, you can make upgrades for their guns to improve your defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/dc7af7bdd6edea1a33c20e8b5ee018f6.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face new challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different maps and test your skills with increasingly difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/81c4731e7bda60257935101e0072f1e4.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn and use ability cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and spend credits after the end of each run to buy abilitiy cards to make it harder for enemies to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/57f3d6bba6e15b2a46419b7573b900a4.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀⠀</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the ranks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve higher scores and rise above other players on the local and global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/b91f85fbcad805c9faa274ce3ac425c1.poster.avif?t=1772202091\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/b91f85fbcad805c9faa274ce3ac425c1.webm?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679920/extras/b91f85fbcad805c9faa274ce3ac425c1.mp4?t=1772202091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
